[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788077885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105172#issuecomment-2788077885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105172","id":2788077885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mLrE9","user":{"login":"CodeZombie","id":466103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjEwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/466103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie","html_url":"https://github.com/CodeZombie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T01:53:44Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T01:53:44Z","body":"Additional info:\n- calling `queue_free()` on the label does not clear the memory or reduce the `object` count.\n- The amount of memory allocated per second increases the longer you leave the program running.  At a rate of `font_size = 5 * delta` at 75fps for ~10 minutes it eats around ~200mb per second.\n- Video Memory is also scaling at the same rate as static memory, so I suspect when you call `add_theme_font_size_override`, the engine likely pre-renders your font at the desired size and sends that to vram.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a569735-5985-410d-b2ad-1d19521b6230)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788077885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788107451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105172#issuecomment-2788107451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105172","id":2788107451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mLyS7","user":{"login":"CodeZombie","id":466103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjEwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/466103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie","html_url":"https://github.com/CodeZombie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T02:08:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T02:08:46Z","body":"Uh oh, looks like this same problem exists in the editor:\n\nHere's a freshly opened Godot editor in Windows Task Manager using about 800mb of ram:\n<img width=\"668\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de643e47-b7ef-4acf-85f1-284e233fa2f4\" />\n\n\nNow, I'm going to create a Label node in a scene, enable `Theme Overrides -> Font Sizes -> Font Size` and then click on the `font size` number slider and drag it around a whole bunch. From 1px to 30,000px, just for demonstration.\n\nAnd now Godot is using 25gb of ram:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd8cbabd-2656-4307-ae2f-a380eb654e68)\n\nClosing the scene does not free the memory, I have to restart the editor.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788107451/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788123654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105172#issuecomment-2788123654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105172","id":2788123654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mL2QG","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T02:23:44Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T02:23:44Z","body":"I think it's just TextServer caching the size data internally.\n\nYou can use `font_clear_size_cache()` to force clear it, for example:\n\n```gdscript\nfor rid in get_theme_font(\"font\").get_rids():\n    TextServerManager.get_primary_interface().font_clear_size_cache(rid)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788123654/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788137965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105172#issuecomment-2788137965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105172","id":2788137965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mL5vt","user":{"login":"CodeZombie","id":466103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjEwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/466103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie","html_url":"https://github.com/CodeZombie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodeZombie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T02:37:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T02:37:51Z","body":"That's solved the issue in my game. Thank you!\n\nThere's still the issue of being able to fill up the text server's font size cache solely within the editor where you can't trivially run that code, but perhaps that should be a separate issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788137965/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]